<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     SPINE     x=700..1080
     LEFT      x=380..660
     RIGHT     x=1140..1480
     LEGEND    x=40..360 (top)
     AMBIENT   x=40..360 (below legend)

     BUSES (exclusive; miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=340   skip / create-only stop (gutter)
       x=1520  status ↔ blocked / implement (east)
       y=1280  Done / finish collector

     Left = ticketless skip + create-only stop
     Right = status lifecycle + blocked gate
     Spine = gate → authorize → create path → backlog
-->
